# Lemmings: cross the Skid Row cracktro, sit through the intro, shoot the title menu.
# The balloon intro also shows 30 colours, so the menu's waits start inside it (frame 3600):
# the black loading screen (3 colours), then the menu (30; reference/title-menu.png). The menu
# animates; 150 frames on, its scroller and lemmings are where the reference has them.
wait 600
click
wait 3000
until colours 3
until colours 30
wait 150
shot title-menu
